 are opening up a door to the astral  realm for as long as the red moon shines  the astral realm will be open and this  circle  is the door and there's an interesting  parallel here with the astral plane from  seoul an area between the soul world and  earth where moon wind opened up a portal  that sent joe's soul into the body of a  cat and 22 into joe's human body in both  movies this astral realm appears to be a  place where spirits or souls can enter  or depart human bodies which surely  conjures up some interesting  possibilities for pixar theories let me  know any ideas theories or connections  you might have about the two films  if you didn't sit through all the  credits you might have missed the funny  little bonus scene at the very end of  the movie featuring jyn dad dancing in  the basement to a four-town song  you know it does yeah  i absolutely loved turning red so for my  next video i'm doing a deep dive into  all the clues that predicted the ending  of the movie i'll add a link here and in  the description so you can watch it as  soon as it's ready so who's your  favorite character in turning red and if  you spotted any other easter eggs let me  know in the comments below if you  enjoyed this don't forget to leave a  thumbs up and subscribe i really  appreciate it thanks for watching and  see you next time yippee kai movie  lovers

